<h1>Sunday Liquor Questions</h1>
<p>The BOE source previously used for these entries is a May 5 primary document. The three November entries still need to be matched against their exact precinct ballots, so this guide is temporarily withholding the establishment names, addresses, and ballot wording.</p>
<p>Use the <a href="https://lookup.boe.ohio.gov/vtrapp/ashtabula/ballotlist.aspx" target="_blank" rel="noopener">official November sample ballot selector</a> and choose your precinct. You can also review the <a href="https://www.ohiosos.gov/assets/2026-11-general-qandi.xlsx" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Ohio Secretary of State local questions and issues workbook</a>.</p>
<p>These questions apply only to the precinct listed on the official ballot.</p>

